WEBVTT

00:00:14.302 --> 00:00:15.036
<v><b>S:</b></v> Can I help you?

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:16.703
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes.

00:00:17.068 --> 00:00:18.828
Do you have these in an eleven?

00:00:27.943 --> 00:00:28.761
<v><b>S:</b></v> Just a minute.

00:00:29.193 --> 00:00:30.005
I’ll go and check.

00:00:30.823 --> 00:00:31.333
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thank you.

00:00:39.573 --> 00:00:40.266
<v><b>S:</b></v> Here you are.

00:00:41.063 --> 00:00:42.162
These are an eleven.

00:00:42.859 --> 00:00:43.776
Do you want to try them on?

00:00:44.432 --> 00:00:46.010
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, thanks.

00:00:46.276 --> 00:00:47.432
I’m sure they’ll be fine.

00:00:55.203 --> 00:00:56.271
<v><b>S:</b></v> That will be eighty pounds.

00:00:57.995 --> 00:01:01.151
<v><b>B:</b></v> Oh, it says ninety-five ninety-nine.

00:01:08.542 --> 00:01:09.912
<v><b>S:</b></v> Yes, they’re on sale.

00:01:11.005 --> 00:01:11.313
<v><b>B:</b></v> Oh.

00:01:12.526 --> 00:01:14.031
Great! Thank you.

00:01:21.536 --> 00:01:22.208
<v><b>S:</b></v> Thank you

00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:26.078
<v><b>S:</b></v> Can I help you?

00:01:26.745 --> 00:01:29.005
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, I just bought these.

00:01:36.865 --> 00:01:37.631
<v><b>S:</b></v> I remember.

00:01:39.656 --> 00:01:40.390
Is there a problem?

00:01:41.176 --> 00:01:44.588
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, they’re too big.

00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:54.036
<v><b>S:</b></v> What size are they?

00:01:54.953 --> 00:01:55.974
<v><b>B:</b></v> They’re an eleven.

00:01:56.531 --> 00:01:58.333
I take a US eleven.

00:02:06.214 --> 00:02:08.292
<v><b>S:</b></v> Oh, right.

00:02:08.948 --> 00:02:12.136
American sizes are always one size larger.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.302
You need a UK ten.

00:02:15.099 --> 00:02:15.953
Just a minute…

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.084
I’m sorry, but we don’t have those in a ten.

00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:30.411
But we do have these and they’re the same price, or you can have a refund.

00:02:31.792 --> 00:02:33.183
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’ll take this pair, then.

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:42.328
<v><b>S:</b></v> Oh, do you have the receipt?

00:02:44.807 --> 00:02:45.213
<v><b>B:</b></v> Sure.

00:02:49.042 --> 00:02:49.526
Here you go.

00:02:58.109 --> 00:02:58.703
<v><b>S:</b></v> Great.

00:02:59.865 --> 00:03:00.339
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thank you.